## Critical Implementation Details

### 1. Ref Forwarding

```typescript
export const InputField = forwardRef<TextInput, InputFieldProps>(
  (props, ref) => {
    return <TextInput ref={ref} {...props} />;
  },
);

InputField.displayName = 'InputField';
```

**Why:** Allows parent components to access TextInput methods (`focus()`, `blur()`, etc.)

### 2. Placeholder Logic

```typescript
const shouldHidePlaceholder = !isFocused && !!label;
const displayedPlaceholder = shouldHidePlaceholder ? '' : placeholder;
```

**Why:** Prevents visual clutter when floating label is shown

### 3. Password Toggle Position

```typescript
// Password toggle takes precedence over suffix
const effectiveSuffix = isPassword ? undefined : appearance?.suffix;

// Render order:
<InputField />
{effectiveSuffix && <InputAdornment />}
{isPassword && <PasswordToggleIcon />}
```

**Why:** Password toggle is always rightmost element

### 4. RTL Support

```typescript
// Automatic in React Native, but ensure:
// 1. Use paddingStart/paddingEnd (not paddingLeft/paddingRight)
// 2. Use translateX (automatically flips in RTL)
// 3. Icon positions handled by Flexbox
```

