  // Runs on UI thread
  return { transform: [...] };
});
```

### 2. Memoization

```typescript
const getInputStyle = useMemo(
  () => ({
    paddingStart: hasPrefix ? prefixIconSize + 12 : 0,
    paddingEnd: hasSuffix ? suffixIconSize + 12 : 0,
  }),
  [hasPrefix, hasSuffix, prefixIconSize, suffixIconSize],
);
```

### 3. Avoid Re-renders

```typescript
