## Modification Patterns

### Adding a New Input Type

1. **Update type definition** (`api/types.ts`):

```typescript
export type InputType = 'text' | 'email' | 'password' | 'number' | 'phone' | 'newType';
```

2. **Add keyboard type mapping** (`utils/keyboard-types.ts`):

```typescript
export function getKeyboardType(type: InputType): KeyboardTypeOptions {
  switch (type) {
    case 'newType':
      return 'numeric';
    // ...
  }
}
```

3. **Update input field logic if needed** (`components/input-field.tsx`)

### Adding a New Adornment Feature

1. **Update interface** (`api/types.ts`):

```typescript
export interface InputAdornmentConfig {
  iconName?: IconName;
  size?: number;
  content?: ReactNode;
  onPress?: () => void;
  color?: string;
