## Common Issues & Solutions

### Issue: Label overlaps icon when unfocused

**Cause:** `prefixWidth` not calculated correctly

**Solution:**

```typescript
// Use the utility function from layout-calculations.ts:
import { calculatePrefixWidth } from './utils';

const prefixWidth = calculatePrefixWidth(hasPrefix, appearance?.prefix?.size);

// And pass it to useInputAnimations:
const { animatedLabelStyle } = useInputAnimations({
  isFocused,
  value: state.value,
  hasError,
  hasPrefix,
  prefixWidth, // Correctly calculated width
  // ...
});
```

### Issue: Animation is jumpy

**Cause:** Icon size changing mid-render

**Solution:**

```typescript
// Use useMemo to stabilize icon size:
const prefixIconSize = useMemo(() => appearance?.prefix?.size || 20, [appearance?.prefix?.size]);
```

### Issue: Touch target too small for adornments

**Cause:** Missing hit slop

**Solution:**

```typescript
// In input-adornment.tsx:
<Pressable
  hitSlop={{ top: 12, bottom: 12, left: 12, right: 12 }}
  onPress={onPress}
>
  {/* content */}
</Pressable>
```

### Issue: Ref not working

**Cause:** Not using forwardRef

**Solution:**

```typescript
// Always use forwardRef for input components:
export const InputField = forwardRef<TextInput, InputFieldProps>(
  (props, ref) => {
    return <TextInput ref={ref} {...props} />;
  },
);
```

